World "Strings"
Title "Strings and Languages"

Introduction "
Before building machines, we need what they read and what they recognise:
**strings** and **languages**.

This world also teaches you the basics of proving things in Lean. Every level is
a statement; you prove it by typing *tactics*, one per line. The goal you still
have to prove is always shown in the middle of the screen.
"
